\nGiven the discussion, Emily might reconsider B due to communication issues, and perhaps shift to C. She could argue that B's communication issues (pretentious, wrong tone, grumpy, uncooperative) are more severe than C's communication difficulty, and that C's reliability and crew atmosphere outweigh. So she may change vote to C.\n\nShe could also ask for more evidence on C's adaptability (willingness to further education) or D's reliability. But need to keep one focused contribution. She could say: \"I am less convinced by B after hearing Sarah and James's points; I now recommend C.\" Provide evidence: B's communication issues, C's 100% reliability, positive crew atmosphere, quick decision making, calm in crisis. Also note C's egocentric but still positive crew atmosphere.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: \"I agree with Sarah and James that C's overall profile is stronger; B's communication issues are too significant; I shift my vote to C.\" Provide evidence.\n\nThen METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
